OL,3,GNEWSAVillage's concern over sewage     
OL,4,Adischarge in dry river                 
OL,6,FA group of residents have said pools of
OL,7,Ftreated sewage are forming on a dry    
OL,8,Friverbed that runs through their       
OL,9,Fvillage during drought conditions.     
OL,11,FThey are calling for the Environment   
OL,12,FAgency to stop the sewage treatment    
OL,13,Fplant in Peterchurch, Herefordshire,   
OL,14,Fdischarging into the River Dore during 
OL,15,Fperiods of no flow.                    
OL,17,FAt the moment, Welsh Water legally     
OL,18,Fdischarges directly into the river, but
OL,19,Fcampaigners said its permit assumed the
OL,20,Feffluent would be diluted by the river 
OL,21,Fflow.                                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
