OL,3,GNEWSAVillage's concern over sewage     
OL,4,Adischarge in dry river                 
OL,6,FThe company said the plant was         
OL,7,Foperating in accordance with the       
OL,8,Fpermit, but it was liaising with       
OL,9,Fresidents over their concerns.         
